adjudication, and anti-repeat fixtures, but `QB-A-01` through `QB-A-48` are
still `draft` and have only pending reviews. Create or review durable editorial
acceptance evidence for the existing four bounded batches only. Do not add
cards, change quiz scope, create code/B/R runbooks, or accept the manifest.

